Package: proxmark3-workshop-setup
Version: 0.71-36
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, python3, python3-tk, zenity
Maintainer: Proxmark3 Workshop
Description: Graphical installer and updater for Proxmark3 Workshop
 Provides a normal Linux Mint/Debian package that opens a graphical setup menu.
 The GUI-only update preserves RRG, firmware and Workshop user data.
